' The historical ColecoVision option screen is presentation only.
' Amy's menu command supplies the cursor, input, and selected value.
u8 Choice = 1

show coleco options
choose menu 1 to 8 into Choice cursor $3E at 3,6 step 2 gap 1 after 4

text screen
print at 8,9, "OPTION SELECTED"
print Choice at 15,11 digits 1
screen on
pause until press and release
